==Description==
'''Lemonade Stand''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It is obtained from Level 19 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|590}} or {{Robux|68}} ({{Robux|57}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|5,460}} or {{Robux|1,250}} ({{Robux|1,053}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Lemonade Stand''' showcases the {{Color|Other|Vendor}} [[Farm]] skin drinking lemonade. It plays the default sound effect for stickers when used. 

